# Pairs with WorkspaceNonDisclosure. A workspace verb needs the app role grant on the tree.
MODULE: AppsBridgeSkipsRoleGrant
TARGET: WorkspaceNonDisclosure
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the bridge allows a declared tree without checking the role grant
PERTURBS: BridgeAuthorize

--- FIND
               ELSE IF ~holds THEN "denied"
--- REPLACE
               ELSE IF FALSE THEN "denied"
--- END
